#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:2
msgid "Two-Node Clusters with a Witness"
msgstr "Clústers de dos nodos con testigo"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:6
msgid ""
"A two-node HVM cluster can use an HPE Shared File System (GFS2) datastore"
" when a Distributed Worker provides an independent quorum vote. This "
"topology is available for HVM layout 1.3 or later and applies wherever "
"HVM is included, including HPE VM Essentials, HPE Morpheus Enterprise "
"Software, and HPE Morpheus Advanced Software."
msgstr ""
"Un clúster HVM de dos nodos puede usar un almacén de datos HPE Shared "
"File System (GFS2) cuando un Distributed Worker proporciona un voto de "
"quórum independiente. Esta topología está disponible para HVM layout 1.3 "
"o posterior y se aplica dondequiera que se incluya HVM, incluidos HPE VM "
"Essentials, HPE Morpheus Enterprise Software y HPE Morpheus Advanced "
"Software."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:8
msgid ""
"The witness is a quorum-only member. It does not run VMs, mount the GFS2 "
"datastore, or become an HVM compute Host. Deploy it outside the failure "
"domain shared by the two HVM Hosts. For vote math and Quorum panel "
"fields, see :doc:`architecture`."
msgstr ""
"El testigo es un miembro de solo quórum. No ejecuta VMs, no monta el "
"almacén de datos GFS2 ni se convierte en un Host de compute HVM. "
"Despliéguelo fuera del dominio de fallo compartido por los dos Hosts "
"HVM. Para el cálculo de votos y los campos del panel Quorum, consulte "
":doc:`architecture`."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:11
msgid "Topology"
msgstr "Topología"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:13
msgid "The logical quorum has three members:"
msgstr "El quórum lógico tiene tres miembros:"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:15
msgid "HVM Host 1"
msgstr "Host HVM 1"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:16
msgid "HVM Host 2"
msgstr "Host HVM 2"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:17
msgid "One Distributed Worker witness"
msgstr "Un testigo Distributed Worker"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:19
msgid ""
"The two Hosts communicate with each other on the Agent quorum network. "
"Each Host must also resolve, reach, and trust the HTTPS Worker URL. "
"|morpheus| derives the witness endpoint as ``<Worker "
"URL>/witness/<cluster UUID>/quorum``."
msgstr ""
"Los dos Hosts se comunican entre sí en la red de quórum del Agente. Cada "
"Host también debe resolver, alcanzar y confiar en la Worker URL HTTPS. "
"|morpheus| deriva el endpoint del testigo como ``<Worker "
"URL>/witness/<cluster UUID>/quorum``."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:21
msgid "Important"
msgstr "Importante"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:21
msgid ""
"The Worker's outbound connection to the |morpheus| appliance does not "
"prove that the HVM Hosts can reach the witness. Validate the Host-to-"
"Worker path independently."
msgstr ""
"La conexión saliente del Worker al dispositivo |morpheus| no demuestra "
"que los Hosts HVM puedan alcanzar el testigo. Valide la ruta Host-Worker "
"de forma independiente."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:24
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "Requisitos previos"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:26
msgid "|morpheus| Manager 9.0 or later"
msgstr "|morpheus| Manager 9.0 o posterior"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:27
msgid "An HVM layout 1.3 or later cluster with exactly two compatible Hosts"
msgstr ""
"Un clúster HVM layout 1.3 o posterior con exactamente dos Hosts "
"compatibles"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:28
msgid "Static management addresses and Host-to-Host connectivity on TCP 7443"
msgstr ""
"Direcciones de administración estáticas y conectividad Host-Host en TCP "
"7443"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:29
msgid ""
"Shared block storage, such as iSCSI or Fibre Channel, visible to both "
"Hosts"
msgstr ""
"Almacenamiento en bloque compartido, como iSCSI o Fibre Channel, visible "
"para ambos Hosts"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:30
msgid "One Distributed Worker outside the two-Host failure domain"
msgstr "Un Distributed Worker fuera del dominio de fallo de los dos Hosts"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:31
msgid ""
"A stable Worker URL whose DNS name, route, firewall port, and certificate"
" chain are valid from both Hosts"
msgstr ""
"Una Worker URL estable cuyo nombre DNS, ruta, puerto de firewall y cadena"
" de certificados sean válidos desde ambos Hosts"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:32
msgid ""
"Enough capacity on either Host to run the workloads that must remain "
"available while the other Host is offline"
msgstr ""
"Capacidad suficiente en cualquiera de los Hosts para ejecutar las cargas "
"de trabajo que deben permanecer disponibles mientras el otro Host esté "
"offline"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:34
msgid ""
"The Worker URL can terminate TLS directly on the Worker or through a "
"supported reverse proxy or load balancer. Preserve the "
"``/witness/<cluster UUID>/quorum`` path when a proxy is used. The "
"external HTTPS port is the port in the configured Worker URL; do not "
"assume the Worker's internal application port is exposed directly."
msgstr ""
"La Worker URL puede terminar TLS directamente en el Worker o a través de "
"un proxy inverso o balanceador de carga admitido. Preserve la ruta "
"``/witness/<cluster UUID>/quorum`` cuando se use un proxy. El puerto "
"HTTPS externo es el puerto de la Worker URL configurada; no asuma que el "
"puerto interno de aplicación del Worker se expone directamente."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:37
msgid "Deployment"
msgstr "Implementación"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:39
msgid ""
"Create the two-Host HVM cluster using :doc:`building_clusters`. Do not "
"add the GFS2 datastore yet. Do not select a witness during initial "
"cluster create."
msgstr ""
"Cree el clúster HVM de dos Hosts usando :doc:`building_clusters`. Aún no "
"agregue el almacén de datos GFS2. No seleccione un testigo durante la "
"creación inicial del clúster."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:40
msgid ""
"Deploy and register a Distributed Worker using :ref:`hvm-witness-"
"deployment`."
msgstr ""
"Implemente y registre un Distributed Worker usando :ref:`hvm-witness-"
"deployment`."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:41
msgid ""
"From both HVM Hosts, verify DNS resolution and TLS connectivity to the "
"Worker URL."
msgstr ""
"Desde ambos Hosts HVM, verifique la resolución DNS y la conectividad TLS "
"con la Worker URL."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:42
msgid ""
"Navigate to |InfClu|, open the cluster, click :guilabel:`Edit`, select "
"the Distributed Worker in the **Witness** field, and save the cluster."
msgstr ""
"Vaya a |InfClu|, abra el clúster, haga clic en :guilabel:`Edit`, "
"seleccione el Distributed Worker en el campo **Witness** y guarde el "
"clúster."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:43
msgid ""
"Add the shared block-storage target to both Hosts and confirm both Hosts "
"resolve the same stable multipath device. See :doc:`storage_operations`."
msgstr ""
"Agregue el destino de almacenamiento en bloque compartido a ambos Hosts y"
" confirme que ambos Hosts resuelven el mismo dispositivo multipath "
"estable. Consulte :doc:`storage_operations`."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:44
msgid ""
"Create the HPE Shared File System (GFS2) datastore and select one "
"reliable datastore as the **Heartbeat Target**."
msgstr ""
"Cree el almacén de datos HPE Shared File System (GFS2) y seleccione un "
"almacén de datos fiable como **Heartbeat Target**."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:45
msgid "Open the cluster **Summary** tab and verify the Quorum panel."
msgstr "Abra la pestaña **Summary** del clúster y verifique el panel Quorum."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:47
msgid ""
"The Manager sends Agent quorum information only after a GFS2 datastore "
"exists. The selected Worker may therefore appear active as a Distributed "
"Worker before it appears as an HVM quorum member. Adding the GFS2 "
"datastore activates the three-member Agent quorum workflow."
msgstr ""
"El Manager envía información de quórum del Agente solo después de que "
"exista un almacén de datos GFS2. Por tanto, el Worker seleccionado puede "
"aparecer activo como Distributed Worker antes de aparecer como miembro de"
" quórum HVM. Agregar el almacén de datos GFS2 activa el flujo de quórum "
"del Agente de tres miembros."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:49
msgid "Warning"
msgstr "Advertencia"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:49
msgid ""
"Do not place production workloads on a new GFS2 datastore until all three"
" quorum members are reachable and the Quorum panel reports a healthy "
"state."
msgstr ""
"No coloque cargas de trabajo de producción en un almacén de datos GFS2 "
"nuevo hasta que los tres miembros de quórum sean accesibles y el panel "
"Quorum informe un estado saludable."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:54
msgid "Witness Deployment"
msgstr "Implementación del testigo"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:56
msgid "Navigate to |AdmIntDis| and create a Distributed Worker configuration."
msgstr "Navegue a |AdmIntDis| y cree una configuración Distributed Worker."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:57
msgid "Set **Worker URL** to the stable client-facing HTTPS URL for the Worker."
msgstr ""
"Configure **Worker URL** con la URL HTTPS estable orientada al cliente "
"del Worker."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:58
msgid "Save the API key."
msgstr "Guarde la clave API."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:59
msgid ""
"Install and configure the Worker using the package or container procedure"
" in :doc:`/administration/integrations/workers`."
msgstr ""
"Instale y configure el Worker usando el procedimiento de paquete o "
"contenedor en :doc:`/administration/integrations/workers`."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:60
msgid "Confirm the Worker is active in |AdmIntDis|."
msgstr "Confirme que el Worker esté activo en |AdmIntDis|."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:61
msgid ""
"From each HVM Host, verify the configured DNS name and TLS path. For "
"example:"
msgstr ""
"Desde cada Host HVM, verifique el nombre DNS configurado y la ruta TLS. "
"Por ejemplo:"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:63
msgid ""
"getent hosts witness.example.com\n"
"curl --head https://witness.example.com"
msgstr ""
"getent hosts witness.example.com\n"
"curl --head https://witness.example.com"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:68
msgid ""
"Do not use ``--insecure`` for production validation. If a reverse proxy "
"or load balancer fronts the Worker, also confirm it preserves the witness"
" path and does not require interactive authentication."
msgstr ""
"No use ``--insecure`` para la validación en producción. Si un proxy "
"inverso o balanceador de carga está delante del Worker, confirme también "
"que preserve la ruta del testigo y no requiera autenticación interactiva."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:70
msgid ""
"After the cluster UUID is available on the cluster detail page, verify "
"the generated witness path from each Host:"
msgstr ""
"Una vez que el UUID del clúster esté disponible en la página de detalle "
"del clúster, verifique la ruta de testigo generada desde cada Host:"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:72
msgid "curl --head https://witness.example.com/witness/<cluster UUID>/quorum"
msgstr "curl --head https://witness.example.com/witness/<cluster UUID>/quorum"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:76
msgid ""
"Replace ``witness.example.com`` with the host in the configured Worker "
"URL. Do not use ``--insecure``."
msgstr ""
"Reemplace ``witness.example.com`` con el host de la URL del Worker "
"configurada. No use ``--insecure``."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:79
msgid "Quorum Validation"
msgstr "Validación de quórum"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:81
msgid ""
"After adding the GFS2 datastore, open |InfClu|, select the cluster, and "
"expand the **Summary** Quorum panel. Confirm:"
msgstr ""
"Tras agregar el almacén de datos GFS2, abra |InfClu|, seleccione el "
"clúster y expanda el panel **Summary** de Quorum. Confirme:"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:83
msgid "Quorum status is **ACHIEVED**"
msgstr "El estado de quórum es **ACHIEVED**"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:84
msgid "Nodes configured: 3 (two Hosts plus the witness)"
msgstr "Nodos configurados: 3 (dos Hosts más el testigo)"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:85
msgid "Both Hosts are online and reachable"
msgstr "Ambos Hosts están online y accesibles"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:86
msgid "The Witness row is present and reachable"
msgstr "La fila del testigo está presente y es accesible"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:87
msgid "There is no **Sites** row"
msgstr "No hay fila **Sites**"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:88
msgid "The Host table is a flat list, not grouped by site"
msgstr "La tabla de Hosts es una lista plana, no agrupada por sitio"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:89
msgid "The Designated Coordinator is one of the two Hosts"
msgstr "El Designated Coordinator es uno de los dos Hosts"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:90
msgid "GFS2 lockspaces are **OK**, not **WAIT FENCING**"
msgstr "Los lockspaces GFS2 están **OK**, no **WAIT FENCING**"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:91
msgid "The selected heartbeat datastore is healthy on both Hosts"
msgstr "El almacén de datos heartbeat seleccionado está sano en ambos Hosts"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:93
msgid ""
"Corosync supplies membership information to DLM but does not decide Agent"
" quorum for layout 1.3 or later. A two-node cluster can show ``Quorate: "
"No`` in ``corosync-quorumtool`` while the Agent Quorum panel correctly "
"reports **ACHIEVED**. Use the Agent quorum state as the operational "
"authority."
msgstr ""
"Corosync proporciona información de pertenencia a DLM pero no decide el "
"quórum del Agente para layout 1.3 o posterior. Un clúster de dos nodos "
"puede mostrar ``Quorate: No`` en ``corosync-quorumtool`` mientras el "
"panel Quorum del Agente informa correctamente **ACHIEVED**. Use el estado"
" de quórum del Agente como autoridad operativa."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:96
msgid "Failure and Maintenance Behavior"
msgstr "Comportamiento ante fallos y mantenimiento"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:102
msgid "Condition"
msgstr "Condición"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:103
msgid "Available votes"
msgstr "Votos disponibles"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:104
msgid "Expected behavior"
msgstr "Comportamiento esperado"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:105
msgid "Both Hosts and witness reachable"
msgstr "Ambos Hosts y testigo accesibles"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:106
msgid "3 of 3"
msgstr "3 de 3"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:107
msgid "Normal operation"
msgstr "Operación normal"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:108
msgid "One Host unavailable; witness reachable"
msgstr "Un Host no disponible; testigo accesible"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:109
#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:112
msgid "2 of 3"
msgstr "2 de 3"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:110
msgid ""
"The surviving Host retains quorum; eligible VMs can recover after the "
"heartbeat failure threshold"
msgstr ""
"El Host superviviente conserva el quórum; las VMs elegibles pueden "
"recuperarse tras el umbral de fallo del heartbeat"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:111
msgid "Witness unavailable; both Hosts reachable"
msgstr "Testigo no disponible; ambos Hosts accesibles"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:113
msgid ""
"The cluster retains quorum, but no Host may be taken offline until "
"witness service is restored"
msgstr ""
"El clúster conserva el quórum, pero ningún Host puede ponerse offline "
"hasta que se restaure el servicio del testigo"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:114
msgid "One Host and the witness unavailable"
msgstr "Un Host y el testigo no disponibles"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:115
msgid "1 of 3"
msgstr "1 de 3"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:116
msgid ""
"The remaining Host cannot retain quorum and protects shared storage by "
"fencing"
msgstr ""
"El Host restante no puede conservar el quórum y protege el almacenamiento"
" compartido mediante fencing"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:117
msgid "Host-to-Host partition"
msgstr "Partición Host-Host"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:118
msgid "Depends on witness reachability"
msgstr "Depende de la accesibilidad del testigo"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:119
msgid ""
"The Host that can reach the witness can form 2 of 3 votes; the other Host"
" cannot retain quorum"
msgstr ""
"El Host que puede alcanzar el testigo puede formar 2 de 3 votos; el otro "
"Host no puede conservar el quórum"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:120
msgid "|morpheus| Manager unavailable"
msgstr "|morpheus| Manager no disponible"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:121
msgid "Unchanged"
msgstr "Sin cambios"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:122
msgid ""
"Agent and witness quorum continue independently; UI management is "
"unavailable until the Manager returns"
msgstr ""
"El quórum del Agente y del testigo continúan de forma independiente; la "
"administración de la interfaz no está disponible hasta que el Manager "
"vuelva"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:124
msgid ""
"Host unreachability is detected after 60 seconds. Eligible VM recovery on"
" the surviving Host follows the 140-second heartbeat failure threshold "
"and requires the witness to remain reachable. Do not treat these timeouts"
" as the same interval."
msgstr ""
"La inaccesibilidad del Host se detecta tras 60 segundos. La recuperación"
" de VMs elegibles en el Host superviviente sigue el umbral de fallo de "
"heartbeat de 140 segundos y requiere que el testigo permanezca "
"accesible. No trate estos tiempos de espera como el mismo intervalo."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:126
msgid ""
"For planned Host maintenance, confirm the witness and the other Host are "
"healthy before entering maintenance mode. Do not maintain a Host and the "
"witness at the same time. Restore all three members before beginning "
"maintenance on the second Host."
msgstr ""
"Para mantenimiento planificado del Host, confirme que el testigo y el "
"otro Host estén sanos antes de entrar en modo de mantenimiento. No "
"mantenga un Host y el testigo al mismo tiempo. Restaure los tres miembros"
" antes de comenzar el mantenimiento del segundo Host."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:129
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "Solución de problemas"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:131
msgid ""
"**Worker active but witness unreachable:** The Worker can reach the "
"Manager, but one or both Hosts cannot reach the Worker URL. Correct DNS, "
"routing, firewall, proxy, or certificate trust."
msgstr ""
"**Worker activo pero testigo inaccesible:** El Worker puede alcanzar el "
"Manager, pero uno o ambos Hosts no pueden alcanzar la Worker URL. Corrija"
" DNS, enrutamiento, firewall, proxy o confianza del certificado."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:132
msgid ""
"**Witness absent from the Quorum panel:** Confirm the Worker is selected "
"on the cluster and a GFS2 datastore exists. The Manager sends Agent "
"quorum information only after GFS2 exists. Allow the cluster refresh to "
"propagate updated quorum information."
msgstr ""
"**Testigo ausente del panel Quorum:** Confirme que el Worker está "
"seleccionado en el clúster y que existe un almacén de datos GFS2. El "
"Manager envía información de quórum del Agente solo después de que "
"exista GFS2. Permita que la actualización del clúster propague la "
"información de quórum actualizada."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:133
msgid ""
"**Sites row on a two-node cluster:** Site Groups were created. Stop and "
"treat this as a stretch misconfiguration. Remove the Site Groups or "
"follow :doc:`stretch_clusters` only if you intended to convert the "
"topology."
msgstr ""
"**Fila Sites en un clúster de dos nodos:** Se crearon Grupos de sitio. "
"Deténgase y trate esto como una configuración incorrecta de tipo "
"extendido. Elimine los Grupos de sitio o siga :doc:`stretch_clusters` "
"solo si su intención era convertir la topología."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:134
msgid ""
"**Wrong witness URL:** Set **Worker URL** to the client-facing Worker "
"endpoint, not the |morpheus| appliance URL. Verify the generated "
"``/witness/<cluster UUID>/quorum`` route through any proxy."
msgstr ""
"**URL de testigo incorrecta:** Configure **Worker URL** con el endpoint "
"Worker orientado al cliente, no con la URL del dispositivo |morpheus|. "
"Verifique la ruta generada ``/witness/<cluster UUID>/quorum`` a través de"
" cualquier proxy."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:135
msgid ""
"**Certificate error:** Serve a complete certificate chain trusted by both"
" HVM Hosts. Do not bypass certificate validation."
msgstr ""
"**Error de certificado:** Sirva una cadena de certificados completa en la"
" que confíen ambos Hosts HVM. No omita la validación del certificado."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:136
msgid ""
"**GFS2 lockspace waiting for fencing:** Do not issue manual fence "
"acknowledgements until the unreachable Host is physically isolated from "
"shared storage. Follow :doc:`troubleshooting` or contact HPE Support."
msgstr ""
"**Lockspace GFS2 esperando fencing:** No emita reconocimientos manuales "
"de fence hasta que el Host inaccesible esté físicamente aislado del "
"almacenamiento compartido. Siga :doc:`troubleshooting` o contacte con el "
"Soporte de HPE."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:137
msgid ""
"**Witness lost during Host maintenance:** Stop the maintenance operation "
"if possible and restore either the witness or the Host before making "
"another member unavailable."
msgstr ""
"**Testigo perdido durante el mantenimiento del Host:** Detenga la "
"operación de mantenimiento si es posible y restaure el testigo o el Host "
"antes de dejar otro miembro no disponible."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:140
msgid "Limitations"
msgstr "Limitaciones"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:142
msgid ""
"A two-node cluster has less compute and maintenance capacity than a "
"three-node cluster."
msgstr ""
"Un clúster de dos nodos tiene menos capacidad de compute y mantenimiento "
"que un clúster de tres nodos."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:143
msgid ""
"The witness is required for Host-failure tolerance; two Hosts without the"
" witness cannot tolerate either Host becoming unavailable."
msgstr ""
"El testigo es necesario para tolerar fallos de Host; dos Hosts sin el "
"testigo no pueden tolerar que cualquiera de los Hosts quede no "
"disponible."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:144
msgid ""
"This topology is not a stretch cluster. It does not use Site Groups or "
"the ``siteWitness`` designation. Do not create Site Groups on a two-node "
"GFS2 cluster; adding them switches the witness classification to stretch "
"``siteWitness``. Site Groups are created from the Host-VM Groups tab; see"
" :doc:`host_vm_groups`."
msgstr ""
"Esta topología no es un clúster extendido. No usa Grupos de sitio ni la "
"designación ``siteWitness``. No cree Grupos de sitio en un clúster GFS2 "
"de dos nodos; agregarlos cambia la clasificación del testigo a "
"``siteWitness`` extendido. Los Grupos de sitio se crean desde la "
"pestaña Host-VM Groups; consulte :doc:`host_vm_groups`."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:145
msgid ""
"The witness does not replace shared-storage redundancy, multipathing, "
"backups, or sufficient capacity on the surviving Host."
msgstr ""
"El testigo no sustituye la redundancia del almacenamiento compartido, el "
"multipath, los backups ni la capacidad suficiente en el Host "
"superviviente."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:146
msgid ""
"Configure one heartbeat target. If it becomes unhealthy, restore it or "
"select another healthy GFS2 datastore before relying on automatic VM "
"recovery."
msgstr ""
"Configure un destino heartbeat. Si deja de estar sano, restáurelo o "
"seleccione otro almacén de datos GFS2 sano antes de confiar en la "
"recuperación automática de VMs."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:148
msgid "For multi-site HVM clusters with site groups, see :doc:`stretch_clusters`."
msgstr ""
"Para clústers HVM multisitio con grupos de sitio, consulte "
":doc:`stretch_clusters`."

